    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i even want to \"just exist\" in it. that just sounds like more waiting. if the cycle is just emptiness over and over, doesn't that mean there's no actual logic in continuing? like, if there's no prize at the end and no real meaning, isn't it more rational to just stop?",
